{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel across dimensions to stop the collapse of the energy core!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>diving deep into corrupted realms to destroy sinister energy-draining altars and face the mastermind behind the chaos. From scorched deserts to futuristic worlds, each jump through the rift is a high-stakes battle for survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time is running out. Dimensions are crumbling. Will you be the one to end this interdimensional disaster?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Exploration \u00d7 Thrilling Combat \u00d7 Countless Equipment Combinations</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beat cute yet silly mobs \u2192 Collect energy \u2192 Explore the map (hunt for gear) \u2192 Brawl with the next wave of cute creeps!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn energy by defeating monsters to unlock in-map treasure chests, gain gear, boost your combat power, stop the evil Dimensional Reaper &quot;Chaos&quot;, and restore cosmic order.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6 Explore Multiversal Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore perilous, distinctively styled multi-dimensional scenes, and challenge ever-evolving monsters and colossal beast-like Bosses!Traverse unique dimensional worlds: Barren Wastelands, Shadowy Forests, Frigid Mechanized Cities... Enemies of all shapes and sizes await your encounter!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grooving little zombies</strong> lost in the beat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>music-obsessed chubby fellow</strong> (<i>Warning: Interrupt his headphones at your peril!</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>badass biker babe</strong> roaring on her ride</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All kinds of ugly-cute and quirky little monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore opportunities that are neither clearly good nor evil!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/128b7639b45e3a466163c6929aab2c58.poster.avif?t=1764225854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/128b7639b45e3a466163c6929aab2c58.webm?t=1764225854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/128b7639b45e3a466163c6929aab2c58.mp4?t=1764225854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Multiple Character Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a variety of characters with unique mechanics and traits for you to choose from!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage: Master of powerful control magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baseball Player: Swing with courage and strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Werewolf: Unleash primal fury and bloodthirsty instincts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mecha Warrior (Gunner): Wield heavy firepower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archer: Agile, graceful, and never misses a shot</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character boasts exclusive powerful skills and passive effects. Their skills can form clever synergies\u2014rational combinations unlock gorgeous combos and devastating damage output!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/43f34dce9ca62ab6c7b3c6970cd6a235.avif?t=1764225854\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/7266786db13859f3a623c8afb786e5b2.poster.avif?t=1764225854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/7266786db13859f3a623c8afb786e5b2.webm?t=1764225854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/7266786db13859f3a623c8afb786e5b2.mp4?t=1764225854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Customized Character Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment System: The game features nearly a hundred types of various equipment awaiting your collection! Match different equipment with different classes to forge your unique build and savor the thrill of exciting loot grinding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect energy core shards from diverse worlds to craft brand-new gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companion System: Immense vitality lies within the damaged energy arrays. Use shards of these arrays to forge your ultimate supportive allies\u2014Offensive &quot;Armed Cat&quot;, Healing &quot;Little Dragon&quot;, and Exploration Support &quot;Huaihuai&quot;! Take them with you to traverse the rifts, making combat and exploration a breeze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/a8690931e84990336a2e50547f6ac102.poster.avif?t=1764225854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/a8690931e84990336a2e50547f6ac102.webm?t=1764225854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/a8690931e84990336a2e50547f6ac102.mp4?t=1764225854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/346efc71696671ec3bb8be07ad710565.poster.avif?t=1764225854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/346efc71696671ec3bb8be07ad710565.webm?t=1764225854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/346efc71696671ec3bb8be07ad710565.mp4?t=1764225854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Epic Boss Fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against the Dimension Reaper, Kaos, a villain who manipulates rifts to devour entire worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-phase Boss Battles \u2013 Kaos summons echoes of fallen worlds and uses powerful skills like rift teleportation and energy siphoning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/e98453c18c2e1d71c08061674487bbf1.avif?t=1764225854\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Jump","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767340/6a477b191f39fc49f2cb3d93f220c2d4cbe652c7.jpg"},{"name":"Hardcore Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767340/f891e18c1c265c0c18dc52eeab16d8e97172638b.jpg"},{"name":"Pummel an Old Pal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767340/8e8e542a94ac3bba2f010d5c5a2a37fa6da3bb5d.jpg"},{"name":"Luckiest Draw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767340/ea6dca067ca18171e8c1d1c8b656a3452fe1abd9.jpg"},{"name":"Rare Item Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767340/f0f5eb1b7899593356700f9e01e3f3142fb745fa.jpg"},{"name":"Relentless Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767340/801c87953ac54becb25c4cce5f0bc5c896e9f4ee.jpg"},{"name":"Elite Nemesis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767340/f3e7cd8431bb1be5cc9ba0c835c63fc9c1b6f4de.jpg"},{"name":"Fracturefront","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767340/e132f924ee951206db2c2a6eec2e30b3d2c848b9.jpg"},{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767340/2a80b3cd0b68df88d54ae22d54ea07ae433cba0c.jpg"},{"name":"Class Freedom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767340/062f38cdffa777d3c5d0a5dbf5323d8ae2f3aa4b.jpg"}],"total":38},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3767340?t=1764225854","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3767340?t=1764225854","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/d62509bd967ec9baf4e3fedbb989836dae9bc287/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764225854","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/d62509bd967ec9baf4e3fedbb989836dae9bc287/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764225854","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3815630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel across dimensions to stop the collapse of the energy core!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>diving deep into corrupted realms to destroy sinister energy-draining altars and face the mastermind behind the chaos. From scorched deserts to futuristic worlds, each jump through the rift is a high-stakes battle for survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time is running out. Dimensions are crumbling. Will you be the one to end this interdimensional disaster?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Exploration \u00d7 Thrilling Combat \u00d7 Countless Equipment Combinations</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beat cute yet silly mobs \u2192 Collect energy \u2192 Explore the map (hunt for gear) \u2192 Brawl with the next wave of cute creeps!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn energy by defeating monsters to unlock in-map treasure chests, gain gear, boost your combat power, stop the evil Dimensional Reaper &quot;Chaos&quot;, and restore cosmic order.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6 Explore Multiversal Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore perilous, distinctively styled multi-dimensional scenes, and challenge ever-evolving monsters and colossal beast-like Bosses!Traverse unique dimensional worlds: Barren Wastelands, Shadowy Forests, Frigid Mechanized Cities... Enemies of all shapes and sizes await your encounter!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grooving little zombies</strong> lost in the beat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>music-obsessed chubby fellow</strong> (<i>Warning: Interrupt his headphones at your peril!</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>badass biker babe</strong> roaring on her ride</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All kinds of ugly-cute and quirky little monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore opportunities that are neither clearly good nor evil!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/128b7639b45e3a466163c6929aab2c58.poster.avif?t=1764225854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/128b7639b45e3a466163c6929aab2c58.webm?t=1764225854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/128b7639b45e3a466163c6929aab2c58.mp4?t=1764225854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Multiple Character Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a variety of characters with unique mechanics and traits for you to choose from!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage: Master of powerful control magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baseball Player: Swing with courage and strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Werewolf: Unleash primal fury and bloodthirsty instincts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mecha Warrior (Gunner): Wield heavy firepower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archer: Agile, graceful, and never misses a shot</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character boasts exclusive powerful skills and passive effects. Their skills can form clever synergies\u2014rational combinations unlock gorgeous combos and devastating damage output!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/43f34dce9ca62ab6c7b3c6970cd6a235.avif?t=1764225854\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/7266786db13859f3a623c8afb786e5b2.poster.avif?t=1764225854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/7266786db13859f3a623c8afb786e5b2.webm?t=1764225854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/7266786db13859f3a623c8afb786e5b2.mp4?t=1764225854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Customized Character Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment System: The game features nearly a hundred types of various equipment awaiting your collection! Match different equipment with different classes to forge your unique build and savor the thrill of exciting loot grinding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect energy core shards from diverse worlds to craft brand-new gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companion System: Immense vitality lies within the damaged energy arrays. Use shards of these arrays to forge your ultimate supportive allies\u2014Offensive &quot;Armed Cat&quot;, Healing &quot;Little Dragon&quot;, and Exploration Support &quot;Huaihuai&quot;! Take them with you to traverse the rifts, making combat and exploration a breeze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/a8690931e84990336a2e50547f6ac102.poster.avif?t=1764225854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/a8690931e84990336a2e50547f6ac102.webm?t=1764225854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/a8690931e84990336a2e50547f6ac102.mp4?t=1764225854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/346efc71696671ec3bb8be07ad710565.poster.avif?t=1764225854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/346efc71696671ec3bb8be07ad710565.webm?t=1764225854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https: